1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,810
The ocean covers most of our planet, waves
roll onto sandy beaches and crash against

2
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:06,980
rocky cliffs.

3
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:11,040
Under the surface, coral reefs
are full of colorful fish.

4
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:14,230
Sea turtles glide through
the clear blue water.

5
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:17,240
Fishing boats leave the
harbor early in the morning.

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:21,330
At sunset, the whole sea
shines with golden light.
